### Base
@host = http://localhost:8080

### 最近30天（UTC毫秒时间戳）
@fromTs = 1773812471564
@toTs = 1776404471564

### 1) 触发 OKX 历史补数（BTC-USDT, 1m）
POST {{host}}/api/internal/price-ticks/backfill/okx
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "instId": "ETH-USDT",
  "fromTs": 1773812471564,
  "toTs": 1776404471564,
  "bar": "1m",
  "pageLimit": 300,
  "maxRounds": 120,
  "sleepMs": 50
}

### 2) 查询补数后的明细（最新200条）
GET {{host}}/api/prices/history?provider=okx_ws&instId=BTC-USDT&from={{fromTs}}&to={{toTs}}&limit=200

### 3) 查询补数后的聚合（1小时桶）
GET {{host}}/api/prices/history/aggregate?provider=okx_ws&instId=BTC-USDT&from={{fromTs}}&to={{toTs}}&bucketMs=3600000&limit=2000